	(text_box "Supply: all five VDD pins run from the 1.8 V rail. 10 uF plus four 100 nF as in Table 87. Place each 100 nF next to its VDD pin and keep the 10 uF close by." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340.36 35.56 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2904e96b-af0e-43c5-95e2-9b58b2c37708"))
	(text_box "Regulators: L1 4.7 uH from DCC to DECD, FB1 from DECD to DECA, C1 2.2 uF on DECD, C2 2.2 uF + C12 10 nF + C5 2.2 nF on DECA (DECRF is tied to DECA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340.36 48.76 0) (size 56 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "26b9774c-63af-4daf-9ddb-ccdd903eeaae"))
	(text_box "VSS_PA (pin 32) goes to ground ONLY at the exposed pad, through net tie NT1. The RF network C6 returns to VSS_PA on the top layer (see the RF sheet)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340.36 59.96 0) (size 56 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4555074a-dfdf-4987-9d6c-fa82d2b93d4b"))
	(text_box "Clocks: 32 MHz crystal on XC1/XC2, 32.768 kHz crystal on P1.00/P1.01. No external load capacitors: internal load capacitors are used (CL 8 pF and 9 pF)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340.36 71.16 0) (size 56 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b0a45b87-a0ec-4190-95af-9b50320653de"))
	(text_box "Reset: R1 1 kOhm in series, C13 3.9 pF to ground. SWDIO, SWDCLK and nRESET go to the Tag-Connect pads on the test sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340.36 84.36 0) (size 56 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8b91c38e-ffc8-40cd-a27b-1b19820952d7"))
	(text_box "GPIO plan: SPI on P2 (SCK on clock pin P2.01), I2C on P0 (SCL on clock pin P0.04), sensor interrupts on P0. P1.04 to P1.07 and P1.09 to P1.14 are left open because of errata 100. P1.02/P1.03 are NFC and unused. Errata 103: GPIO state is undefined for 10 us at reset, so LED_BOOST_EN has a pull-down." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340.36 95.56 0) (size 56 14.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d8257502-77fc-416a-8a68-7280a1a3f3e7"))
